Hi guys,

Well firstly thanks to all who helped with suggestions to find my way
off the first level of hell. Here's what happened.

A unicorn of my alignment appeared on the level, so I figured with
nothing better to try I would get my luck up (via gem throwing) and
then try walking over the trapdoors on the castle level.

On the way over to the stairs there was a nymph which I promptly 
despatched. Instead of leaving the usual mirror plus potion of object
detection he also left a cursed ring of teleportation. Hooray!

I'm now back on level 23 waiting for a scroll of teleportation to 
appear. I'm at 60,000 plus moves now but it will be worth it when I've
finished.

